# Cloudflare Pages routing.
# Any /project/<slug>/ or /immersive/<slug>/ URL is served by the shared
# template shell, which then loads content from Sanity by slug at runtime.
# This means new pages appear automatically when the client adds a project in
# Sanity — no per-slug HTML files and no build/sync step required.
#
# Existing static files (index.html, css/, js/, the template files themselves)
# always win over these rules, so only unknown slugs hit the rewrites.

/project/*      /project/template.html      200
/immersive/*    /immersive/template.html    200
